<lb n="33"/>Wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> ouch nit ermanglen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelche</unclear> E. E. W. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fry</unclear>-
